      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Mayadenawa se acercó al campamento dormido, moviéndose como una sombra entre los árboles.",
          "en": "Mayadenawa crept toward the sleeping camp, moving like a shadow between the trees."
        },
        {
          "es": "Para esconder su rastro, caminó sobre los costados de los pies, así sus huellas quedaban torcidas.",
          "en": "To hide his tracks, he walked on the sides of his feet, so his footprints leaned sideways."
        },
        {
          "es": "Nadie adivinaría que esas huellas raras eran suyas.",
          "en": "Nobody would ever guess that those strange prints were his."
        },
        {
          "es": "El lugar por donde caminó todavía se llama Tampaksiring, que significa 'huellas inclinadas'.",
          "en": "The place where he walked is still called Tampaksiring, which means 'tilted footprints'."
        }
