        {
          "es": "Golpeó el suelo con toda su fuerza, y un manantial de agua pura brotó de la tierra.",
          "en": "He struck the ground with all his strength, and a spring of pure water burst out of the earth."
        },
        {
          "es": "Lo llamaron Tirta Empul, el manantial sagrado.",
          "en": "It was called Tirta Empul, the holy spring."
