      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Entonces Indra salió a cazar a Mayadenawa.",
          "en": "Then Indra went hunting for Mayadenawa."
        },
        {
          "es": "El demonio huyó por los arrozales, cambiando de forma para esconderse.",
          "en": "The demon fled across the rice fields, changing his shape to hide."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se volvió un ave enorme. Donde se posó hay ahora una aldea llamada Manukaya, de manuk, la palabra para ave.",
          "en": "He became a great bird. Where he landed, there is now a village called Manukaya, from manuk, the word for bird."
        },
        {
          "es": "Indra lo siguió, sin perderlo nunca de vista.",
          "en": "Indra followed him, never letting him out of his sight."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los viejos relatos nombran más disfraces, y cada uno le dio nombre a un lugar.",
