      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Por último, Mayadenawa se convirtió en una piedra junto al río.",
          "en": "At last, Mayadenawa turned himself into a stone by the river."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se quedó perfectamente quieto, como si siempre hubiera estado ahí.",
          "en": "He stood perfectly still, as if he had been there forever."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero Indra no se dejó engañar. Tensó su arco y disparó una flecha directo a la piedra.",
          "en": "But Indra was not fooled. He drew his bow, and shot an arrow straight into the stone."
        },
        {
          "es": "La magia se rompió, y el rey demonio cayó, vencido al fin.",
          "en": "The magic broke, and the demon king fell, defeated at last."
        }
